<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson 9-mo sales by division.</title>
<headline>Ericsson 9-mo sales by division.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ericsson reports the following sales by division for the first nine months of the year to September 30.</p>
<p>					  (million Swedish crowns)</p>
<p>					Jan-Sept 1996	 Jan-Sept 1995</p>
<p> Radio Communications		     49,718  vs  37,355</p>
<p> Public Telecommunications		15,469  vs  16,353</p>
<p> Business Networks			  10,203  vs   9,635</p>
<p> Components				    5,471  vs   5,327</p>
<p> Microwave Systems			   2,762  vs   2,433</p>
<p> Other Operations			    1,980  vs   1,512</p>
<p> Group transfers		    CHARGE 7,402  vs   5,714 CHARGE</p>
<p>NOTE - Ericsson said in its nine month 1996 report that the order intake of the radio communications business area had increased by 32 percent. It said orders intake for the public telecoms business area was up by 19 percent for comparable units.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
